<title>USA: Phibro taps Christopher Mahoney to head sugar desk.</title>
<headline>Phibro taps Christopher Mahoney to head sugar desk.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Christopher Mahoney, former director and vice president of Cargill International S.A., was appointed head of Phibro Inc's sugar trading group at its Westport, Conn., headquarters, Phibro said.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640))</p>
